  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water as a connector for resilient landscapes in Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to contribute to water security, improved and climate-resilient livelihoods, and restoration and conservation of key ecosystems in the Santa Cruz region. The specific objective is to enable local and national stakeholders to promote and successfully implement transformative policies to enhance water security and integrated sustainable landscape management (ISLM) approaches.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
